description: TypeScript and React conventions for KirayeChat
globs: src/**/*.{ts,tsx}
alwaysApply: false
---

# TypeScript

- Strict TypeScript. No `any`. Use `unknown` and narrow.
- Named exports. UI units: `ui/{camelCase}/index.tsx`; props and local types in sibling `type.ts`.
- Server data: `async` functions in `src/features/<name>/queries.ts` or `actions.ts`.
- Client data: Supabase Realtime only inside `src/features/chat`.
- Handle errors; do not swallow. User-facing copy in Azerbaijani.
- Tailwind only via className. No inline style unless a dynamic pixel value is required.
